  *  Flee. The sooner you run, higher your profit. Leap NITM will have high delta.
     Thus it acts like a synthetic stock.

  ** Find the earliest NOTM to break-even and back to normalcy
     Longer you wait, more difficult it will become

  When in doubt if a bear or bull is coming, stay weekly. If it goes up rapidly, you can
  wait it out or roll-up. If it goes down rapidly, you can Leap!


